          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><hr />\n<h2 id=\"nerve-cell-heterogeneity-explorer\">Nerve Cell Heterogeneity Explorer</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Visualizes results from the nerve-cell subset and heterogeneity Snakemake rules.\nRequires the pipeline to have been run through the <code>nerve_cell_heterogeneity</code> rule.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><em>Per-cluster readers (<code>nerve_enrichment.csv</code>, <code>nerve_cluster_markers.csv</code>,\n<code>nerve_tumor_interactions.csv</code>, <code>nerve_tumor_top_pairs.csv</code>) now have\n<code>_with_qc.csv</code> companions produced by the <code>annotate_cluster_qc</code> rule \u2014\neach row carries <code>batch_qc_pass</code> and purity context so QC-failing clusters\ncan be flagged in any downstream view.</em></span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
